	(gr_text "POE_PRI_MOAT (placeholder zone, resize to enclose placed primary-side components):\nEnforces >=2.5mm copper clearance from any POE_PRI-netclass copper to all other-net copper\n(see .kicad_dru). POE_PRI = POE_VA+/-, POE_VB+/-, POE_VDD54, POE_VDD54_F, POE_VSS, POE_RTN,\nplus TPS23730/Q20/T1-primary control nets N_AUX,N_BT,N_BTLED,N_CLSA,N_CLSB,N_COMP,N_CS,\nN_CS_SNS,N_DEN,N_DT,N_DTHR,N_FRS,N_GAT2,N_GATE,N_GATE_Q,N_ISTP,N_LINEUV,N_PPD,N_REF,N_SST,\nN_SW,N_VB,N_VBG,N_VCC (traced from the netlist: every net touching U10/Q20/BR1/BR2/D7, plus\nT1 pins 1-5, U20 pins 3-4, U23 pins 1-2). The moat rule exempts pad pairs sharing the same\nreference designator so it does not false-positive on T1/U20/U23/C19 (the certified\nbarrier-crossing parts, per schematic note on power_input.kicad_sch) -- their own internal\ncreepage is governed by part rating, not board copper spacing."
		(at 5 10 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "4662d1b4-9ce4-43f6-b583-298ebe60c187")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(thickness 0.135)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "EP-VIA: hand-solder thermal-via pads to add under these exposed-pad parts during layout:\n  U2 (CH224K), U10 (TPS23730RMTR), U13/U14 (INA226 x2),\n  Q20 (FDMS86250), Q22/Q23 (BSC057N08NS3 x2, sync-rect FETs)"
		(at 5 20 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "7052f15a-82bc-4f9f-9171-7c2ae078a9ae")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "STACKUP: JLCPCB JLC7628 (JLC04161H-7628), 4L 1.6mm, L1 sig / In1 GND / In2 PWR / L4 sig.\nL1-In1 & In2-L4 dielectric: 7628 prepreg, 0.2104mm, Er=4.4 (Nan Ya NP-155F 7628, per\nJLCPCB-published stackup). Core In1-In2: 1.065mm FR-4, Er=4.43. Cu: L1/L4 1oz(0.035mm),\nIn1/In2 0.5oz(0.0152mm). Source: jlcpcb.com/impedance (JLC7628 4L 1.6mm) and the\nJLCPCB-derived KiCad stackup template jlcpcb_4L_1.6mm_outer1oz_inner0.5oz_JLC04161H-7628."
		(at 5 40 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "6cc5484c-b9d9-47aa-8579-153f5968c3ba")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
